4. Permitted Uses

Subject to this License, You may use the Licensed Material for:

a. cybersecurity research;
b. Authorized Security Testing;
c. red-team, blue-team, and purple-team exercises;
d. defensive security engineering and detection development;
e. vulnerability research;
f. internal enterprise security testing;
g. internal security-product evaluation;
h. Commercial Cybersecurity Use;
i. education, classroom laboratories, CTFs, and academic research;
j. reproduction and validation of security research;
k. development of interoperable security tooling;
l. private or internal AI research, analysis, indexing, retrieval, fine-tuning, and
   Training consistent with Section 8; and
m. publication of legitimate research results, including reasonable excerpts of the
   Licensed Material necessary to explain such research.

5. Commercial Use and Commercialization

5.1 Permitted Commercial Cybersecurity Use.
Commercial Cybersecurity Use is permitted. The fact that You or Your Organization
receives compensation does not by itself make an otherwise permitted cybersecurity
use prohibited.

5.2 Restricted Commercialization.
Without separate written permission from Licensor, You may not Commercialize the
Licensed Material. In particular, You may not:

a. sell or license CloudBasher itself or a substantially repackaged or derived version
   of it as a commercial software product;
b. offer the Licensed Material or a substantially derived version primarily as a paid
   hosted service or "CloudBasher-as-a-Service";
c. make the Licensed Material the principal commercial value of an appliance,
   subscription, hosted offering, or software product;
d. remove or replace this License and offer substantially the same Licensed Material
   under commercial terms that negate the restrictions of this License.

5.3 Consulting and Managed Services.
Section 5.2 does not prohibit consulting, penetration testing, managed security,
incident response, training, or other professional services merely because the
Licensed Material is used as a tool in performing those services, provided the
customer is not being sold or licensed the Licensed Material itself as the principal
commercial deliverable.

5.4 Outputs.
Reports, findings, logs, detection rules, screenshots, benchmarks, and other outputs
produced through permitted use of the Licensed Material are not subject to the
Commercialization restriction merely because they were produced using CloudBasher,
unless they themselves contain a substantial portion of the Licensed Material.

